Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The universal proof relies on an unsound empty-list bridge that makes `[]` truthy and permits a demonstrably false result to prove with `#Top`. It also proves only an unconnected abstract list representation for arbitrary lengths.

Detailed findings: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Evidence and command logs: [evidence](/audit-output/evidence/)
